{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36703","headline":"西塞山 · 罗隐","name":"西塞山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吴塞当时指此山，吴都亡後绿孱颜。\n岭梅乍暖残妆恨，沙鸟初晴小队闲。\n波阔鱼龙应混杂，壁危猿狖奈奸顽。\n会将一副寒蓑笠，来与渔翁作往还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36703.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36703","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}